KNOWNBUG
ifdef_boolean_expression1.sv

^\[main\.p0\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p1\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p2\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p3\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p4\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p5\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p6\] always 1: PROVED .*$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
IEEE 1800-2023 22.6 allows Boolean expressions in `ifdef, `ifndef, and `elsif,
with the operators !, &&, ||, -> and <->, and parentheses.
